   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/9lhU_470cjs/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Versace unveils the Fall Winter 2026 eyewear campaign. A study of mood and gesture, emphasising the physicality at the heart of the House.
An evolution of the Greca campaign, unveiled in 2025, actor Joseph Quinn returns to embody a series of characters that capture the striking facets of Versace—an intimate portrait, photographed by Heikki Kaski, inviting a closer gaze and consideration. 

Quinn wears the Vance eyewear: sunglasses and spectacles defined by their bold geometry; a sleek body, clashing refinement and daring, bearing Versace’s signature Medusa.

Fall Winter 2026 eyewear will be available at Versace stores and online from October 1st.</media:description>
